<title>USA: Hampton sees Q4 profit from lower expenses.</title>
<headline>Hampton sees Q4 profit from lower expenses.</headline>
<dateline>KINSTON, N.C. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hampton Industries Inc said Friday it expects a fourth quarter profit in-line with management expectations.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the company reported a third quarter profit of $0.59 per share.  </p>
<p>The company's year-ago earnings were $0.38.</p>
<p>Hampton said advance orders are in-line with company expectations and based its expectations of a fourth quarter profit on improved margins and lower operating expenses.</p>
</text>
